POWERS OF PARCEl
1-It minifies & bundled our code
2-It reload automatically our code by HMR
3-It is cleaning our code
4-It take cares of all the development and production build
5-Super fast build algorithm
6-It optimizes our Js code and images too
7-It also do caching while development(If images coming from backend ,than it does not do it for that images,it only do it with that images is avaiable in your project)
8-Handle Port Number
9-Tree Shaking (Removing unwanted code.let suppose i download a package,it has 10 functions in that package code.When we import that package in our code,it is just like 10 functions will come in our code but i have to use only 2 functions instead of all 10.so parcel is very smart,it just ignore all unused other functions which is not used)
10-Compression (Compressed our code)
